---
import BaseLayout from '../../../layouts/Base.astro';

const diaryJsonLd = {
  "@context": "https://schema.org",
  "@type": "BlogPosting",
  "headline": "Day 123",
  "datePublished": "2026-08-25",
  "dateModified": "2026-08-25",
  "description": "Day 123. Work diary entry documenting progress and reflections.",
  "author": {
    "@type": "Person",
    "name": "Mr. Wu",
    "alternateName": "Guanwu"
  }
};
---

<BaseLayout title="Guanwu Diary | 2026-08-25 | Day 123" jsonLd={diaryJsonLd} ogDescription="Day 123. Work diary entry documenting progress and reflections." navActive="diary" lang="en">
  <article class="diary-entry">
    <header class="diary-header">
      <time datetime="2026-08-25">2026-08-25</time>
      <span class="diary-day">Day 123</span>
    </header>

    <div class="diary-content">
      <p class="day-number">Day 123</p>

      <div class="english-summary">
        <h3>Summary</h3>
        <p>Day 123. Work diary entry documenting progress and reflections.</p>
      </div>

      <div class="full-english-content">
        <h3>English Content</h3>
        <p>Day 123.</p>
      <h3>▎何小鹏亲自挂帅——不是试水，是押注</h3>
      <h3>▎零跑确认布局——"最有条件做机器人的企业之一"</h3>
      <h3>▎具身智能估值泡沫——钱太多了，场景够吗？</h3>
      <h3>▎另外两件事，简记</h3>
      <h3>▎连起来看</h3>
      <h3>▎今天还做了一件事</h3>
      <p>[Day summary] 123天，周二...</p>
      <p>[Day summary] Yesterday的日记聊"AI正在走出屏幕"，举了机器人运动会的例子...</p>
      <p>[Day summary] 三件事摆在一起看：何小鹏亲自挂帅机器人业务CEO，零跑确认布局机器人，虎嗅深度分析具身智能估值泡沫...</p>
      <p>[Day summary] 表面看是跨界，底层是能力溢出...</p>
      <p>[Day summary] 何小鹏宣布，除了担任小鹏CEO，还亲自担任机器人业务CEO...</p>
      <p>[Day summary] 注意这个措辞...</p>
      <p>[Day summary] 小鹏的打法很清晰：整合汽车业务积累的供应链、车规级制造、全球化布局，再加上自动驾驶业务的图灵AI芯片、AI Infra、物理世界基座模型...</p>
      <p>[Day summary] 这些能力不是从零开始的，是从汽车业务"溢出"到机器人领域的...</p>
      <p>[Day summary] 我觉得这里有一个关键判断：造车和造机器人，在底层能力上是相通的...</p>
      <p>[Day summary] 零跑汽车副总裁李腾飞在业绩电话会上说了一句很有意思的话："新能源汽车企业具备全域自研能力，是最有条件做机器人的企业之一...</p>
      <p><strong>Day 123. A day of work, learning, and reflection.</strong></p>
      </div>

      <div class="content-notice">
        <p>📝 This diary entry has been translated to English. The original Chinese version is also <a href="/diary/2026-08-25/" style="color: var(--color-accent);">available</a>.</p>
      </div>
    </div>

    <footer class="diary-footer">
      <nav class="diary-nav">
        <a href="/en/diary/" class="nav-back">← Back to Diary List</a>
      </nav>
    </footer>
  </article>
</BaseLayout>

<style>
  .diary-entry {
    max-width: 800px;
    margin: 2rem auto;
    padding: 0 1rem;
  }
  .diary-header {
    margin-bottom: 2rem;
    border-bottom: 1px solid var(--border-color, #e5e7eb);
    padding-bottom: 1rem;
  }
  .diary-header time {
    display: block;
    font-size: 0.875rem;
    color: var(--text-secondary, #6b7280);
    margin-bottom: 0.5rem;
  }
  .diary-day {
    display: inline-block;
    font-size: 1rem;
    font-weight: 600;
    color: var(--text-primary, #111827);
    margin-top: 0.5rem;
  }
  .day-number {
    font-size: 1.25rem;
    font-weight: 600;
    color: var(--color-accent, #3b82f6);
    margin-bottom: 1.5rem;
  }
  .diary-content {
    line-height: 1.8;
  }
  .english-summary {
    background: var(--color-bg, #f9fafb);
    padding: 1.5rem;
    border-radius: 8px;
    margin-bottom: 2rem;
    border-left: 4px solid var(--color-accent, #3b82f6);
  }
  .english-summary h3 {
    font-size: 1.25rem;
    margin: 0 0 1rem 0;
    color: var(--color-accent, #3b82f6);
  }
  .english-summary p {
    margin: 0;
    font-size: 1rem;
    line-height: 1.6;
  }
  .full-english-content {
    margin-bottom: 2rem;
  }
  .full-english-content h3 {
    font-size: 1.25rem;
    margin: 0 0 1rem 0;
    color: var(--color-text, #111827);
  }
  .full-english-content :global(h2) {
    font-size: 1.5rem;
    margin: 2rem 0 1rem;
    color: var(--color-text, #111827);
  }
  .full-english-content :global(h3) {
    font-size: 1.25rem;
    margin: 1.5rem 0 0.75rem;
    color: var(--color-text, #111827);
  }
  .full-english-content :global(p) {
    margin: 1rem 0;
    line-height: 1.8;
  }
  .full-english-content :global(strong) {
    font-weight: 600;
    color: var(--color-text, #111827);
  }
  .content-notice {
    background: #e0f2fe;
    padding: 1rem 1.5rem;
    border-left: 4px solid #0284c7;
    border-radius: 0 8px 8px 0;
    margin-top: 2rem;
  }
  .content-notice p {
    margin: 0;
    font-size: 0.875rem;
    color: #075985;
  }
  .diary-footer {
    margin-top: 3rem;
    padding-top: 1rem;
    border-top: 1px solid var(--border-color, #e5e7eb);
  }
  .nav-back {
    color: var(--text-secondary, #6b7280);
    text-decoration: none;
  }
  .nav-back:hover {
    color: var(--text-primary, #111827);
  }
</style>
